sections.purpose_text:
We process your data for the following purposes:
• handling inquiries submitted via the contact form (name, email, phone number, message) - to respond and establish cooperation;
• performing surveying contracts - to the extent required to deliver the service;
• website traffic analysis - only after you grant consent in the cookie banner (see “Cookies and analytics”);
• ensuring website security and proper operation - including remembering your language preference and your cookie choice.

sections.legal_text:
We process your data on the following legal grounds:
• Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR - your freely given consent (contact form, analytics cookies);
• Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR - performance of a contract or taking pre-contractual steps (surveying assignments);
• Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR - compliance with a legal obligation (statutory archiving of accounting and tax records);
• Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR - our legitimate interest (website security, essential cookies, archiving correspondence to defend against potential claims).

sections.retention_text:
We keep your data no longer than necessary:
• contact-form data - up to 24 months from the last contact;
• contract-related data and accounting/tax records - for at least 5 years from the end of the financial year, in accordance with art. 74(2) of the Polish Accounting Act and art. 86 § 1 of the Polish Tax Code;
• analytics cookies (Google Analytics 4) - up to 14 months from the last activity;
• essential cookies - until the browser session ends or for up to 12 months.

sections.recipients_text:
Your data may be shared with the following categories of recipients (each under a data-processing agreement compliant with Art. 28 GDPR):
• Vercel Inc. (USA) - website hosting and serverless functions handling the contact form; processes your IP address and browser headers on every visit;
• Resend, Inc. (USA) - email delivery service used to send your contact-form message to the controller;
• Google LLC (USA) - Gmail mailbox to which the email from the form is delivered;
• Google Ireland Limited / Google LLC (Ireland / USA) - Google Analytics 4 provider (only after you grant consent in the cookie banner);
• law firms, architectural offices and other partners cooperating on a specific surveying project - only to the extent necessary to perform the contract with you.
We do not sell your data and do not share it with third parties for marketing purposes.

sections.rights_text:
Regarding our processing of your data, you have the right to:
• access your data and obtain a copy;
• rectify (correct) inaccurate or outdated data;
• erase your data (“the right to be forgotten”);
• restrict processing;
• object to processing;
• data portability to another controller;
• withdraw consent at any time - without affecting the lawfulness of processing carried out on the basis of consent before its withdrawal;
• lodge a complaint with the supervisory authority - the President of the Personal Data Protection Office (Stawki 2, 00-193 Warsaw, uodo.gov.pl).

sections.transfer_text:
As part of normal website operation and contact-form handling, your data may be transferred to the United States to the following recipients:
• Vercel Inc. - website hosting and serverless functions (technical visit data: IP address, browser headers) - on every page request;
• Resend, Inc. - email delivery from the contact form (form contents) - only when you submit an inquiry;
• Google LLC - the controller's Gmail mailbox where the email is delivered;
• Google LLC - Google Analytics 4 (anonymized traffic data) - only after your consent.

Transfers are made on the basis of:
• European Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2023/1795 of 10 July 2023 establishing an adequate level of protection of personal data under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework - for entities certified under the DPF (Vercel, Google LLC, Google Analytics; certificates at dataprivacyframework.gov);
• Standard Contractual Clauses approved by the European Commission (Art. 46(2)(c) GDPR) - additionally for Resend, Inc.

All other data is processed within the European Economic Area.
